sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Maya as Maya
    participant Test as /3c-test --mode=integration
    participant Deploy as /3c-deploy
    participant Stage as Staging env
    participant Bug as /3c-bug
    participant Issue as GitHub Issue

    Maya->>Test: invoke for UI/integration change
    Note over Test: test-author subagent assists
    Test-->>Maya: UAT checklist + edge cases scaffolded

    Maya->>Deploy: --env=staging
    Note over Deploy: pre-flight checks run
    Deploy->>Stage: deploy succeeds
    Stage-->>Deploy: health check passes
    Deploy-->>Maya: ready for UAT

    Note over Maya: walks the checklist<br/>manually in staging
    Maya->>Maya: finds a regression in empty-state

    Maya->>Bug: invoke /3c-bug
    Note over Bug: captures OS / runtime /<br/>project state / recent commits /<br/>scrubbed env vars
    Bug-->>Issue: structured report appended
    Maya->>Issue: re-opens and comments

    Note over Deploy: production deploys<br/>require --yes
